+<!-- LICENCES-PAGE-20261025 -->
+## Offline Settings licences page (2026-10-25)
+LCP01-LCP06/R01/Q01: Add permanent guest/release Settings > Licences with fixed notice selection, offline selectable text, clickable source/licence links and finger scrolling without drag-release link activation. Exact running-engine MIT/component notices, five font OFLs, flags/Unicode, audio/music credits, shader/godot-cpp and platform runtime notices are included. AndroidX/Identity/AdMob notices are copied byte-exactly from pinned existing SDK archives; Ads entry follows Android debug availability. Fifteen authored rows cover all eleven languages; legal bodies remain exact. Focused520headless/532Compatibility/532desktopMobile, App141, parser1197, authoringPython7 and featuretranslation180 pass. Actual Android content ZIP contains16exact notice texts and compiled reader scripts; no APK. Broad localization completeness retains unrelated/concurrent gaps and its unit suite one completeness failure. Initial policy/sandbox/fixture/finger-drag/export-timeout failures and corrected results are recorded. Matched public Pixabay crash/grass listings supplement, rather than rewrite, historical local source records. Commands, native screenshots, source limits and task-only review patch: docs/LICENCES_PAGE_2026_10_25.md and docs/evidence/licences-page-2026-10-25/report.json. Reload and owner/device acceptance remain. No device attachment check/test, authentication/purchase, live mutation, deployment or owner-process restart; concurrent work preserved.
+<!-- /LICENCES-PAGE-20261025 -->
+
 <!-- GARAGE-OPTIONS-FOCUS-20261025 -->
 ## Garage right-side options and main-view focus (2026-10-25)
 GOF01-GOF03/R01/Q01: Patterns now joins Parts in the two-column right-side catalogue; no duplicate large photo or detail viewport. Opening editing focuses the main Garage: actual-model body fit for Patterns/Colours, category/surface close-ups for Parts/Stickers. All seven models fit two window sizes while preserving viewing direction. Cancel keeps editing focus with equipped cosmetics; leaving restores exact camera/orbit values. This supersedes the prior Appearance carousel and zoom-out-on-cancel expectations. Focused425headless/475Compatibility/475desktopMobile, retained1396/App141/sidebar549/view-gestures65 and parser1199 pass. Initial title/selection/direction captures and an exact-orbit regression are retained; scalar storage fixes rounding without relaxing assertions. Options, commands, native before/after, hashes and task-only checkpoint: docs/GARAGE_OPTIONS_FOCUS_2026_10_25.md and docs/evidence/garage-options-focus-2026-10-25/report.json. Reload and owner/device appearance/touch acceptance remain. No device attachment check/test, APK, real purchase, live mutation, deployment or owner-process restart; concurrent work preserved.
